        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Before proceeding ahead, it will be pertinent to refer to the provision of law involved in the present case."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "1a442045e58e44d494ec8e50d2376588_42",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "STA"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Section 59 of the Act provides for punishment for the manufacture, storage, sale, distribution and import of any article of food for human consumption, which is unsafe."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "dd9d71eba4c842a88a700bc06788fc12_44",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "There are various parameters mentioned under the said definition which makes the food unsafe and the categories for ready reference are mentioned as below:"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "b77d946de25d4500b7ad8b79d62dfd06_45",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "STA"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "(zz) unsafe food means an article of food whose nature, substance or quality is so affected as to render it injurious to health:--\n(i) by the article itself, or its package thereof, which is composed, whether wholly or in part, of poisonous"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "aa33dd13fbc14c41b751da62104acb55_46",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Further, as per the regulation 2.4.4 of the Food and Standard (Food Products and Additives),\nRegulations 2011, provides that the Besan shall not contain any added colouring matter or any other foreign ingredient."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "098b3724fba04efdb77941e3b23d2d44_47",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Thus, in the present case, the product as per the report of RFL does not conforms to the standards of the regulation as Cr. Case 6368-2021 FSO vs Narender Kumar Page No. 6 of 12 mentioned above, as presence of live and dead larvae and insec"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "547eab5479194bc787faad51fc99e887_55",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Further, as per the regulations, there was no requirement to add any preservative except in the case of perishable items, which is not the Cr. Case 6368-2021 FSO vs Narender Kumar Page No. 8 of 12 case."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "a43576a4d9e14c8e8edf26946f0efc7c_57",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "13. After going through the record and the submissions of the parties, no material contradiction is found in the testimony of the witnesses with respect to the lifting of sample and subsequent proceedings conducted."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "a75f0a8ce5304629a6979557dae5b7cb_58",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "However, it is to be considered whether the sample was stored in a air tight container as no preservative was added and also in the light of the statement of the Food safety Officer that no insects were seen at the the time of the lifting o"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "6cee19a4981f47ebaf9b60c947aa2380_59",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "After going through the testimony of witnesses, no evidence has come on record that samples were stored in a proper air tight container and the FSO has not given any reasoning in the entire complaint for not adding the preservative and whet"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "7c7d220f90df440c838b5770a383641b_60",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Prosecution has also not placed on record any regulation to support the contention except the submission that the preservative are added in the perishable items which appears to be logical reasoning but considering the peculiar facts of thi"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "26f6303e22844441a8907088235a3776_61",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "It cannot be said that it was the duty of the Public Analyst to report the same as the Food Safety Officer is a trained personnel who is imparted training for collection of the samples and presence of the insects could have been easily asce"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "979a9d0fb2a74302b43446737400f740_62",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The judgment relied upon by the Ld defence counsel is applicable to the facts of the present case also as the FSO has categorically made the statement that no insects were seen by him at the time of lifting of the sample."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "02e5ecd5a10d4ff9a5f3e57a9618ea02_63",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Therefore, it casts a doubt whether the insects were present in the sample on the date of sample proceedings by the FSO or it got Food Safety Officer vs Narender Kumar on 5 June, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/54310505/\n5 "
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "45f7a967d5a640b3a5f88d3aeae456a7_64",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "14. Though the report of the Food Analyst stood replaced by the Certificate of Director, RFL but for the limited purposes, it can be looked into."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "371e20291ac74b95bd3b64c1d23a1ade_65",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "It is pertinent to note that the FA has mentioned the colour of the sample upon physical appearance but did not mention regarding the presence of the insects and after the examination of the sample after 13 days, he has observed that upon p"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "b7cdf064fd384da9b76dfe46f3a4740b_66",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Since, the insect infestation is possible at any stage of the proceedings if not properly stored and the presumption cannot be raised that the insects were in the sample since the beginning when no such thing was noticed by the FSO who went"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "8e54bce442ce40b9bf2bb34f12badb1a_67",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The analysis of the samples were done by the RFL after a period of two months and thus, infestation of the insects in the sample Cr. Case 6368-2021 FSO vs Narender Kumar Page No. 10 of 12 were found, which corroborates the version of the ac"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "9a8c4b46d8804e4caa509d87bc9fefde_68",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "It is correct that the evidence has to been seen as a whole but upon the analysis of the evidence, nothing is found to establish that the insects were present in the sample from the date of its lifting."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "fab10b63439e4bf7ac3b2342acb1e3ec_69",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Also, the judgment relied upon by the Ld SPP is not applicable to the facts & circumstances of the present case."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "7a7d7c8d5c7a4f51a6ef94021c516630_70",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\n15. In the present case, no infirmity was found with respect to the other parameters of sample of Besan except the insects found in the same, which as discussed above, might have occurred at a later date from the date of sampling as there "
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "04df4ebe31b24a43aa7606f1fc8ac6b1_71",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
